== Introduction (What is the Paper about?)

- #strong[Rapid Review] on the #strong[migration from monoliths to
  microservices]
- #strong[Aim:] Gathering, organizing and analyzing migration techniques

== Methods

- #strong[Rapid Review]
  - comprised 20 research articles
  - 70% applications web-based
  - more than 90% applications are Java-based

== Scientific Benefit

- #strong[Identification of three migration techniques]
  + #emph[Model-Driven (DD)]
  + #emph[Static Analysis (SA)]
  + #emph[Dynamic Analysis (DA)]
- #strong[Case Studies are most widely used for validation] followed by
  experiments and examples

== Challenges / Future Work

== Limitations

- Rapid Review provides a rather lightweight methodology to analyze the
  migration process
  - it may result in reduced coverage

